# PHP branch -> upstream source strategy
#
# phpnet    supported branches; source = newest sury SRC_DIST source package
#           (contains the current php.net release tarball + debian packaging),
#           rebuilt unmodified for DIST with a greensec changelog suffix.
#
# security  EOL branches; source = remicollet/php-src-security git branch
#           (PHP-<branch>-security-backports) + last sury DIST packaging.
#           Quilt patches may need manual refresh - see README.
